{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":30,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Psalm ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," Song ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["at"]}," the dedication of the house of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 30:1"},"I will extol thee, O LORD; for thou hast lifted me up, and hast not made my foes to rejoice over me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 30:2"},"O LORD my God, I cried unto thee, and thou hast healed me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 30:3"},"O LORD, thou hast brought up my soul from the grave: thou hast kept me alive, that I should not go down to the pit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 30:4"},"Sing unto the LORD, O ye saints of his, and give thanks at the remembrance of his holiness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 30:5"},"For his anger ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["endureth but"]}," a moment; in his favour is life: weeping may endure for a night, but joy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["cometh"]}," in the morning. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 30:6"},"And in my prosperity I said, I shall never be moved. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 30:7"},"LORD, by thy favour thou hast made my mountain to stand strong: thou didst hide thy face, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," I was troubled. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 30:8"},"I cried to thee, O LORD; and unto the LORD I made supplication. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 30:9"},"What profit ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is there"]}," in my blood, when I go down to the pit? Shall the dust praise thee? shall it declare thy truth? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 30:10"},"Hear, O LORD, and have mercy upon me: LORD, be thou my helper. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 30:11"},"Thou hast turned for me my mourning into dancing: thou hast put off my sackcloth, and girded me with gladness; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 30:12"},"To the end that ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my"]}," glory may sing praise to thee, and not be silent. O LORD my God, I will give thanks unto thee for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 30:12"}]}]}
